<!--
  The status-bar icon for every notification this app posts.

  A small icon is alpha-masked by the system: only the shape survives, and the platform tints it.
  So it must be a flat white silhouette on a transparent background. Handing a launcher icon (or
  anything with its own colours and a filled background) to setSmallIcon is the classic mistake, and
  renders as a solid blob in the status bar.
-->
